<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,449 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,449 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,449 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,447 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 29		  Oct 28</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,449		   5,447</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)   3.09		    3.90</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
